This repository is a port of the code-modernization plugin from
anthropics/claude-plugins-official (https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official,
plugins/code-modernization, Apache License 2.0) to the ZCode plugin format.

Copyright for the original plugin and its scripts, agent definitions, command
prompts, workflow logic, report template and topology viewer belongs to
Anthropic, PBC; this port modifies and redistributes that work under the
Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE), with these changes: commands adapted to the
ZCode plugin format ($ARGUMENTS parsing, CreateWorkflow integration,
filesystem-based source protection in preflight Check 7), workflows rewritten
from the Claude Code workflow runner to ZCode dynamic-workflow TypeScript,
telemetry and function-hook UI modules removed, and agent tool lists adapted
to ZCode tool names. See plugins/code-modernization/README.md for details.

The vendored topology viewer embeds Mermaid (MIT), see
plugins/code-modernization/assets/vendor/LICENSE-mermaid.txt.
